__pycache__/

# Credentials. This repo is PUBLIC and, since 2026-08-31, the data plane runs on
# Flo's PC instead of GitHub Actions - so scripts/*.py now read a real Google
# service-account key from disk (GSC_KEY_PATH, normally C:\Users\Flo\Downloads\
# gsc-key.json) and Supabase creds from an env file, instead of Actions secrets.
# Nothing stops a stray copy landing in this folder, and a commit here is public
# immediately. Audit 2026-09-01 confirmed no credential has ever been committed
# to this repo; this keeps it that way.
.env
.env.*
*key*.json
!data/*.json
gsc-key.json
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.p12
